From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu Apr  3 16:10:10 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 03 Apr 2014 16:10:10 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] adding constraints for parameters in Stan model
Message-ID: <fAqBYSf3u6o.NIFYBsCoChAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <fAqBYSf3u6o.NplwT9JwpH4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <fAqBYSf3u6o.WR6q_yMp0v0J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <fAqBYSf3u6o.NplwT9JwpH4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
