From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Wed Apr  9 12:15:54 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Wed, 09 Apr 2014 12:15:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Speeding up stan for big data!
Message-ID: <Kx-aFSrTcvc.JGbrihb9w5IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Kx-aFSrTcvc.eN43TNooAuMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Kx-aFSrTcvc.79QJVTSCKz4J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <Kx-aFSrTcvc.eN43TNooAuMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
