        g[k] <- -d[k]*(t[i] - T[k] - alpha[k]);
      }
      y[i] ~ categorical(softmax(g));
    }
where this time the d and alpha had been previously inferred, t is known data and y is an unknown label - possibly a vector/simplex of 21 probabilities of a label - that's where I had intended trying to go.

