Subject: Multi-level Bayesian Framework using Arrays of Different Dimensions
Message-ID: <Dm7aQ-Wo-HQ.WOKE84w8DCYJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/Dm7aQ-Wo-HQ/m/WOKE84w8DCYJ>
